What is Ferrite Core Transformers?
Ferrite core transformers consist of a magnetic core fabricated from Mn‑Zn or Ni‑Zn ferrite powders, wrapped with copper windings that operate efficiently at switching frequencies ranging from tens of kilohertz up to several megahertz. Their high magnetic permeability combined with low core loss makes them ideal for SMPS, power‑factor correction modules, LED drivers, inverter front‑ends and a broad spectrum of high‑frequency converter topologies.
